From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:40:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BD-J: use the vertical scaling factor for the height of the
 video area

BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.setVideoTransformation() (the
playlist one and the drip one) computes the height of the video area
from scales[0], the horizontal factor of the VideoTransformation
(getScalingFactors() returns { horizontal, vertical }). A transformation
with different factors, such as an anamorphic squeeze, is stored with
the horizontal factor in both directions, and getVideoTransformation()
and getSize() then report back a height the Xlet did not ask for. Use
scales[1] for the height.

The same slip as the six copies of getVideoStreams() in
PlayItemImpl.getComponents(), found while looking for others after
CroqueMr/libreelec-x86-DV issue #26 (skull-01; the 2160p fall-through
and the stream lists were found by SamuriHL). Unchanged in libbluray
master f33a738fd7bb.
---
 .../playlist/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java        | 2 +-
 .../dvb/mpeg/drip/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/playlist/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/playlist/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
index ae6464c..e9e7efc 100644
--- a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/playlist/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
+++ b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/playlist/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@ public class BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl extends VideoControl
         setVideoArea(new HScreenRectangle(
                                           pos.x, pos.y,
                                           vd.width * scales[0] / sd.width,
-                                          vd.height * scales[0] / sd.height));
+                                          vd.height * scales[1] / sd.height));
         return true;
     }
 
diff --git a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/video/dvb/mpeg/drip/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/video/dvb/mpeg/drip/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
index 6c695f6..55c6150 100644
--- a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/video/dvb/mpeg/drip/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
+++ b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/media/content/video/dvb/mpeg/drip/BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl.java
@@ -44,7 +44,7 @@ public class BackgroundVideoPresentationControlImpl extends VideoControl
         Dimension sd = getScreenSize();
         setVideoArea(new HScreenRectangle(pos.x, pos.y,
                                           vd.width * scales[0] / sd.width,
-                                          vd.height * scales[0] / sd.height));
+                                          vd.height * scales[1] / sd.height));
         return true;
     }
 
